{"1453460": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Trials of Argolis", "steam_appid": 1453460, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Game</strong></h2>Trials of Argolis is a <strong>First-Person meele combat Bossrush</strong> set in Ancient Greece mixed with some fantasy elements.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Gameplay</strong></h2>Trials of Argolis combines First-Person movement with <strong>fast paced melee combat requiring quick reflexes</strong> and well timed reactions, playing with a controller is recommended.<br>After defeating a Boss you'll be rewarded with Trial-Medals which you can use to improve different physical attributes.<br>There are <strong>6 difficulty settings</strong> to choose from ranging from very forgiving to brutally difficult <strong>including a Perma-Death mode</strong> for the ultimate challenge.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Opponents</strong></h2>The game features <strong>15 unique Bossfights</strong> inlcuding one secret fight. The fights require your full attention if you want to succeed but vary in difficulty.<br>The Bosses do not need to be defeated in any particular order with a few exceptions.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Environments</strong></h2>You'll visit <strong>four different environments</strong> over the duration of the game which also vary in time of day.<br>After overcoming an opponent you are free to explore their sometimes quite expansive arenas.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Please Note</strong></h2>This game supports Mouse and Keyboard, Dualshock 4 Controller and Xbox One Controller. Support for any other controllers cannot be guaranteed.", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Game</strong></h2>Trials of Argolis is a <strong>First-Person meele combat Bossrush</strong> set in Ancient Greece mixed with some fantasy elements.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Gameplay</strong></h2>Trials of Argolis combines First-Person movement with <strong>fast paced melee combat requiring quick reflexes</strong> and well timed reactions, playing with a controller is recommended.<br>After defeating a Boss you'll be rewarded with Trial-Medals which you can use to improve different physical attributes.<br>There are <strong>6 difficulty settings</strong> to choose from ranging from very forgiving to brutally difficult <strong>including a Perma-Death mode</strong> for the ultimate challenge.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Opponents</strong></h2>The game features <strong>15 unique Bossfights</strong> inlcuding one secret fight. The fights require your full attention if you want to succeed but vary in difficulty.<br>The Bosses do not need to be defeated in any particular order with a few exceptions.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Environments</strong></h2>You'll visit <strong>four different environments</strong> over the duration of the game which also vary in time of day.<br>After overcoming an opponent you are free to explore their sometimes quite expansive arenas.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Please Note</strong></h2>This game supports Mouse and Keyboard, Dualshock 4 Controller and Xbox One Controller. Support for any other controllers cannot be guaranteed.", "short_description": "Every year daring warriors and fighters from all across the land travel to the province of Argolis to partake in a sacred trial of strength and endurance.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1453460/header.jpg?t=1618592839", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1453460/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1618592839", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1453460/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1618592839", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:<